            "target_entity_instance": "RCP4.5",
            "target_entity_type": "Experiment",
            "paragraph": "The \u00d6KS15 data is comprised of 13 regional climate model simulations that have been corrected for bias using the EURO-CORDEX downscaling method. These simulations have a high resolution of 1\u00d71 km and cover the time period from 1971 to 2100. They are based on two Representative Concentration Pathways, namely a baseline scenario, RCP4.5, and a high-emission \"business-as-usual\" RCP8.5.",
